config DRM_GMA3600
	tristate "Intel GMA 3600 (Cedar Trail)"
	depends on DRM && PCI && X86
	select DRM_KMS_HELPER
	select DRM_GEM_SHMEM_HELPER
	select I2C
	select I2C_ALGOBIT
	select BACKLIGHT_CLASS_DEVICE
	help
	  Direct Rendering Manager (DRM) and Kernel Mode Setting (KMS) driver
	  for the Intel GMA 3600 integrated graphics controller found in Intel
	  Atom Cedar Trail processors (D2500, D2550, D2700, N2600, N2800).

	  This driver provides full kernel modesetting, atomic page flipping,
	  hardware cursor, DPMS power management, GMBUS DDC EDID probing,
	  backlight control, and compatibility with modern X.Org Server versions
	  via the generic modesetting DDX driver, as well as modern Wayland
	  compositors.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module will be
	  called gma3600.
